Z||000013||fiero56||06-27-2001||11:49 PM||||I recently bought a "sta-cool"(I think) replacement radiator for my Formula for $65 at AutoZone earlier this year. I was all metal(don't know what kind of metal) and was painted gloss black everywhere. <P>If you want, you can have my old radiator for cost of shipping, but it needs to be taken apart and cleaned, my car always ran hot with that radiator, that's why I replaced it.||||reg||1
Z||000014||theogre||06-28-2001||12:04 AM||||Aside from the article being about Dexcool, it contains pictures that explain the caps...<BR> <A HREF="http://imcool.com/articles/anitfreeze-coolant/dexcool-macs2001.htm" TARGET=_blank>http://imcool.com/articles/anitfreeze-coolant/dexcool-macs2001.htm</A> <P>These are the same caps referenced in my cave.||||reg||1
